sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Command as command
  participant Service as UserService
  participant Client as UserApiClient
  participant Api as User API
  Command->>+Service: UserName() - unchanged
  Service->>+Client: UserName()
  Client->>+Api: GET /getUserName
  Api-->>-Client: "17 Lee"
  Client-->>-Service: nameId 17, surname Lee
  Service->>+Client: NameById(17)
  Client->>+Api: GET /getNameById?id=17
  Api-->>-Client: "Ann"
  Client-->>-Service: Ann
  Note over Service: composes the two answers
  Service-->>-Command: name Ann, surname Lee - unchanged
